<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHTS- Qwest surges higher.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHTS- Qwest surges higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Qwest Communications Inc, which is building a nationwide fiber-optic network, surged 27 percent at its market debut on Tuesday after its initial public offering.</p>
<p>The stock jumped six to 28 in heavy trading, with nearly 4.5 million shares traded early in the session. The gains were even more impressive considering the terms of the IPO were ratcheted higher ahead of the offering.</p>
